1
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:07,280
(wool noises)

2
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:08,880
(whispers) SO fluffy!

3
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:09,420
Hey!

4
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:11,620
(whispers) Sheep never let me get this close.

5
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:13,640
(whispering) You can't just touch a sheep's wool!

6
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:14,180
It's like cotton candy.

7
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:15,080
Stop it!

8
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:15,580
Where to?

9
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:19,040
(gasps) Ah, rainforest district, vine and Tujunga.

10
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:21,700
There! Traffic cams for the whole city!

11
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:23,280
Oh this is so exciting actually,

12
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:24,520
I mean, well, you know,

13
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:26,460
I never get to do anything this important.

14
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:28,400
But you're the assistant mayor of Zootopia?

15
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:30,520
Oh, I'm more of a glorified secretary.

16
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:33,200
I think Mayor Lionheart just wanted the sheep vote,

17
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:35,280
but he did give me that nice mug!

18
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:37,160
Oh, hmm.

19
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:38,580
Feels good to be appreciated.

20
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:39,080
(beep)

21
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:40,100
LIONHEART: "Smell-wether!"

22
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:42,500
Agh, that's a fun little name he likes to use.

23
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:45,300
I called him "Lion-fart" once,

24
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:47,920
and he did not care for that one, let me tell you,

25
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:49,040
it wasn't a good day for me. Yes sir?

26
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:50,920
LIONHEART: I thought that you were gonna cancel my afternoon!

27
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:52,180
Oh dear.

28
00:00:52,180 --> 00:00:54,020
I better go, let me know what you find.

29
00:00:54,080 --> 00:00:56,580
It was really nice for me to be...

30
00:00:56,580 --> 00:00:58,000
LIONHEART: While we're young, "Smell-wether"!

31
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,480
Oh! (grunts)

32
00:01:00,860 --> 00:01:02,860
Do you think that when she goes to sleep, she counts herself?

33
00:01:02,860 --> 00:01:03,520
Oh, shush.

